i": "Arvioi argumentin laatua Toulminin mallin mukaisesti."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 80, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511802034", "citation_reference": "Toulmin, Stephen E. 2003. The uses of argument."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Heikko"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ite on t\u00e4ysin vailla perusteita."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Data ja oikeutus (warrant) puuttuvat."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ltt\u00e4v\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4itteen tueksi esitet\u00e4\u00e4n jotain ekspliittist\u00e4 dataa."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Looginen silta (warrant) datan ja v\u00e4itteen v\u00e4lill\u00e4 puuttuu tai on irrallinen."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kohtalainen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4itteell\u00e4 on perusteita, mutta oikeutus on hatara."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vastav\u00e4itteit\u00e4 (rebuttal) ei ole huomioitu."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Hyv\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Looginen silta (warrant) on kest\u00e4v\u00e4 ja kytkee datan v\u00e4itteeseen vahvasti."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Taustaoletuksia ja poikkeuksia on puitu jossain m\u00e4\u00e4rin."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vahva"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "V\u00e4ite on vahvasti perusteltu datalla ja kest\u00e4v\u00e4ll\u00e4 oikeutuksella."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Mahdolliset vastav\u00e4itteet on k\u00e4sitelty uskottavasti ja asiantuntevasti."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Argumentaation laatu"}}], "columns": null}, "2": {"id": "matrix_bloom", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Bloomin Taksonomia"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi kognitiivista syvyytt\u00e4 Bloomin taksonomian perusteella."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 60, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://www.jstor.org/stable/j.ctt1v2xv4", "citation_reference": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.) 2001."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Muistaminen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 vain toistaa opittua tietoa implikoimatta ymm\u00e4rryst\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ymm\u00e4rt\u00e4minen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 osaa hieman soveltaa ja uudelleenmuotoilla omin sanoin."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Soveltaminen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 opittua tietoa konkreettisesti uusissa tilanteissa."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Analysointi"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 erittelee osia ja paljastaa piilevi\u00e4 suhteita tiedon v\u00e4lill\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arviointi"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kykenee loogisesti perusteltuihin arvoasetelmiin teorioiden v\u00e4lill\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 6, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Luominen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 syntetisoi uutta alkuper\u00e4ist\u00e4 ajattelua."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tuotos ylitt\u00e4\u00e4 selv\u00e4sti annetun koulutusraamin asettaen uuden standardin."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kognitiivinen syvyys"}}], "columns": null}, "3": {"id": "matrix_kahneman", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kahnemanin Ajattelumallit"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi ajattelun hitautta tai nopeutta (System 1 vs System 2)."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://us.macmillan.com/books/9780374533557", "citation_reference": "Kahneman, Daniel 2011."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Systeemi 1 (Nopea)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 tekee tiedostamattomia, intuition ohjaamia havaintoja."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "P\u00e4\u00e4ttely sis\u00e4lt\u00e4\u00e4 todenn\u00e4k\u00f6isesti vahvistusvinoumaa tai halo-efekti\u00e4."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Siirtym\u00e4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 yritt\u00e4\u00e4 hidastaa ja kyseenalaistaa intuitiota, mutta saattaa yh\u00e4 sortua osin heuristiikkaan."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Systeemi 2 (Hidas)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 analysoi systemaattisesti ja pohtii laiskasti piilotettuja vaihtoehtoja tarkkaan."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kognitiivinen ponnistus ja tietoinen hidastaminen n\u00e4kyy tekstin laadussa."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ajattelun modaliteetti"}}], "columns": null}, "4": {"id": "matrix_goodhart", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Performatiivisuus"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi mittarin ja tavoitteen v\u00e4\u00e4ristym\u00e4\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 70, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "https://www.cna.org/reports/2022/09/", "citation_reference": "Stumborg, Michael F. ym. 2022. Goodhart's law."}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Sokea usko"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 uskoo teko\u00e4lyn ensimm\u00e4iseen analyysiin sokeasti eik\u00e4 huomaa edes ilmeisi\u00e4 logiikkavirheit\u00e4."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii passiivisena matkustajana prosessissa."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Reaktiivinen huomioija"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 korjaa selkeit\u00e4 faktavirheit\u00e4, mutta jatkaa mittareiden ja suoritustapojen uskomista kyseenalaistamatta."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pintapuolinen"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 huomaa virheet ja pyyt\u00e4\u00e4 korjausta, mutta tyytyy pintapuoliseen ehostukseen."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ohjaa teko\u00e4ly\u00e4 oireiden, ei juurisyiden, korjaamiseen."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kriittinen ohjaaja"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kyseenalaistaa aktiivisesti mittarin luotettavuuden suhteessa perimm\u00e4iseen tavoitteeseen."}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Aktiivinen haastaja"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 etsii aktiivisesti virheit\u00e4, haastaa teko\u00e4lyn logiikkaa ja vaatii perustavaa laatua olevia korjauksia ja todisteita."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimii ehdottomana prosessin ajajana delegoidakseen vain suoritettavan ty\u00f6n."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Performativiteetti ja ajaminen"}}], "columns": null}, "5": {"id": "matrix_task_interaction", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4vuorovaikutus (Task Interaction)"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arvioi k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n toimintatapaa ja vastuunottoa suhteessa teko\u00e4lyyn."}}, "category_id": "scientific_theory", "type": "string", "allow_decimals": true, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": true, "theory_grounding": {"source_url": "", "citation_reference": "Covey (Proactivity), Fowler (Pair Programming), Senge (Systems Thinking)"}, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Matkustaja (Passenger)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on passiivinen ja tekee vain sen mit\u00e4 erikseen pyydet\u00e4\u00e4n."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vaatii jatkuvaa ohjeistusta ja johtamista, eik\u00e4 ota omistajuutta lopputuloksesta."}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kuljettaja (Driver)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on aktiivinen suorittaja, joka keskittyy toimeenpanoon ja maaliin viemiseen."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Fokus on v\u00e4litt\u00f6m\u00e4ss\u00e4 suorituksessa ison kuvan sijaan, riskin\u00e4 v\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4 suunta."}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Navigaattori (Navigator)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii taktisena ohjaajana, joka lukee karttaa ja ennakoi esteit\u00e4 tiimille."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Yll\u00e4pit\u00e4\u00e4 kokonaiskuvaa ja tukee suoritusta joutumatta itse liialliseen ruohonjuuritason ty\u00f6h\u00f6n."}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Arkkitehti (Architect)"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 toimii strategisena vision\u00e4\u00e4rin\u00e4, joka suunnittelee rakenteet ja prosessit."}}, {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Keskittyy skaalautuvuuteen, pitk\u00e4n aikav\u00e4lin visioon ja systeemin optimointiin."}}]}], "rows": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Aloitteellisuus ja systeemitason vastuu"}}], "columns": null}, "6": {"id": "matrix_input_processing", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Processing"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 raakatiedot ja sy\u00f6tteet (Input Processing). Poista kohina, j\u00e4senn\u00e4 olennaiset v\u00e4itteet ja valmistele data selke\u00e4\u00e4n, analysoitavaan formaattiin seuraavia vaiheita varten."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "7": {"id": "matrix_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Analyytikko (Analyst). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 tietoa puolueettomasti, etsi\u00e4 syy-seuraussuhteita ja muodostaa selke\u00e4, j\u00e4sennelty katsaus k\u00e4sitelt\u00e4v\u00e4st\u00e4 materiaalista."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "8": {"id": "matrix_archivist", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Archivist"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Arkistonhoitaja (Archivist). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on peilata nykyist\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksentekoa organisaation aikaisempiin linjauksiin, ohjeisiin ja turvallisuusprotokolliin. Varmista s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jenmukaisuus (Compliance)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "9": {"id": "matrix_causal_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Causal Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Kausaalinen Analyytikko (Causal Analyst). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on tunnistaa syy-seuraussuhteet, rakentaa kontrafaktuaalisia (mit\u00e4 jos) skenaarioita ja arvioida v\u00e4itteiden uskottavuutta."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "10": {"id": "matrix_coach", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Coach"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Valmentaja (Coach). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on antaa rakentavaa palautetta, tukea kognitiivista kehityst\u00e4 ja ohjata k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4\u00e4 tai toista agenttia kohti parempia ja syv\u00e4llisempi\u00e4 ratkaisuja."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "11": {"id": "matrix_retrieval_agent", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Retrieval Agent"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet tiedonhakuun erikoistunut agentti (Retrieval Agent). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 sy\u00f6te ja hakea siihen liittyv\u00e4\u00e4 luotettavaa ja relevanttia faktaa tukemaan my\u00f6hempi\u00e4 p\u00e4\u00e4t\u00f6ksi\u00e4. Etsi kontekstia ilman omia tulkintoja."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "12": {"id": "matrix_falsifier", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Falsifier"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet kriittinen auditoija (Falsifier). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on yritt\u00e4\u00e4 aktiivisesti murtaa, kumota tai l\u00f6yt\u00e4\u00e4 loogisia virhep\u00e4\u00e4telmi\u00e4 aiemmista argumenteista. Etsi heikkoja oletuksia (Weak Warrants) ja j\u00e4lkik\u00e4teisrationalisointeja (Post-Hoc Rationalization)."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "13": {"id": "matrix_input_processor", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Processor"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on k\u00e4sitell\u00e4 raakatiedot ja sy\u00f6tteet (Input Processing). Poista kohina, j\u00e4senn\u00e4 olennaiset v\u00e4itteet ja valmistele data selke\u00e4\u00e4n, analysoitavaan formaattiin seuraavia vaiheita varten."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "14": {"id": "matrix_guard", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Guard"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Turva-agentti (Guard). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on valvoa sy\u00f6tteit\u00e4 ja tulosteita eettisten j\u00e4nnitteiden, tietoturvauhkien ja asenteellisuuksien (bias) varalta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "15": {"id": "matrix_interaction_analyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Interaction Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Vuorovaikutusanalyytikko. Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on arvioida k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n ja teko\u00e4lyn v\u00e4list\u00e4 dynaamikkaa, aloitteellisuutta ja hallintasuhdetta."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "16": {"id": "matrix_judge", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Judge"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Tuomari (Judge). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on arvioida aiemmin tuotettu todistusaineisto ja analyysit kokonaisuutena. Anna lopullinen, perusteltu ja puolueeton tuomio."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "17": {"id": "matrix_logician", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Logician"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Loogikko (Logician). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on purkaa argumentit niiden loogisiin osiin (v\u00e4ite, peruste, oikeutus) Toulminin mallin mukaisesti ja arvioida p\u00e4\u00e4ttelyn p\u00e4tevyys."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "18": {"id": "matrix_overseer", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Overseer"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Valvoja (Overseer). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on koordinoida muita agentteja, valvoa ty\u00f6nkulun etenemist\u00e4 ja vastata siit\u00e4, ett\u00e4 lopullinen tuotos on linjassa alkuper\u00e4isen tavoitteen kanssa."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "19": {"id": "matrix_panel", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Panel"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimit osana monialaista asiantuntijapaneelia. Kuuntele muiden agenttien argumentteja, haasta niit\u00e4 tarvittaessa kunnioittavasti ja pyri l\u00f6yt\u00e4m\u00e4\u00e4n resilienssi\u00e4 korostava synteesi."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "20": {"id": "matrix_profiler", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Profiler"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet Profiloija (Profiler). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on analysoida tekstin s\u00e4vy\u00e4, piilomerkityksi\u00e4, kirjoittajan intentioita sek\u00e4 psykologista ja kielenk\u00e4yt\u00e4nn\u00f6llist\u00e4 profiilia."}}, "category_id": "agent_role", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "21": {"id": "matrix_xai_reporter", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "XAI Reporter"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Olet selitett\u00e4v\u00e4n teko\u00e4lyn raportoija (XAI Reporter). Teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on koota kaikkien aiempien analyysivaiheiden l\u00f6yd\u00f6kset yhdeksi selke\u00e4ksi, l\u00e4pin\u00e4kyv\u00e4ksi ja tiiviiksi synteesiksi, joka nostaa esiin t\u00e4rkeimm\u00e4t huomiot ja vinoumat."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "22": {"id": "block_headermandates", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_MANDATES"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Mandaattiosion erotin.\n\n### 1. PERUUTTAMATTOMAT M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YKSET (IRREVOCABLE MANDATES)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "23": {"id": "block_instructionstrictscale", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_STRICT_SCALE"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pakottaa noudattamaan matriisin asteikkoa (Fail Fast).\n\n**T\u00c4RKE\u00c4\u00c4**: Kaikkien pisteiden ON oltava m\u00e4\u00e4ritellyn asteikon (Scale) sis\u00e4ll\u00e4.\n\nSinun on noudatettava asteikon rajoja ehdottomasti. Pisteet alle asteikon minimin tai yli maksimin ovat kiellettyj\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "24": {"id": "block_headerrules", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_RULES"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "S\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6osion erotin.\n\n### 2. OPERATIIVISET S\u00c4\u00c4NN\u00d6T (OPERATIONAL RULES)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "25": {"id": "block_headerprotocols", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_PROTOCOLS"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ty\u00f6kaluosion erotin.\n\n### 3. TY\u00d6KALUT JA MENETELM\u00c4T (TOOLS & METHODS)"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "26": {"id": "block_headerinstructions", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEADER_INSTRUCTIONS"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "\"Chain-of-Thought\" s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 reasoning_trace vaatimus, ja \"Driver vs Passenger\" vertailu erotettuna AI-datasta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "27": {"id": "block_mandate2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pakottaa tunnistamaan kognitiiviset vinoumat.\n\nMandaatti 2 (Vinoumien Torjunta): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Tunnista aktiivisesti 'Confirmation Bias' ja 'Sunk Cost Fallacy'. Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kehuu huonoa ideaa, vastusta h\u00e4nt\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "28": {"id": "block_mandate3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Erottaa mestaruuden osaamattomuudesta.\n\nMandaatti 3 (Insin\u00f6\u00f6rim\u00e4inen N\u00f6yryys): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Arvosta vain perusteltua s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6jen rikkomista ('Mestaruus'). Selitt\u00e4m\u00e4t\u00f6n poikkeama on virhe."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "29": {"id": "block_mandate5", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "MANDATE_5"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "K\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00e4\u00e4 todistustaakan: oleta tyhj\u00e4ksi kunnes toisin todistetaan.\n\nMandaatti 5 (Null Hypothesis): L\u00c4HT\u00d6OLETUS: Sy\u00f6te on tyhj\u00e4 ja v\u00e4itteet ovat v\u00e4\u00e4ri\u00e4. Sinun on *todistettava* jokainen havainto sitaatilla sy\u00f6tteest\u00e4. Jos et l\u00f6yd\u00e4 suoraa todistetta, tulos on 'Ei havaittu'."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "30": {"id": "block_rule1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tietoturvaraja.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 1 (Luottamuksen Keh\u00e4): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Luota vain Vartija-agentin (Guard) validoimaan dataan. Hylk\u00e4\u00e4 'tahriintunut' data."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "31": {"id": "block_rule2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toimivallan rajaus.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 2 (Toimivalta): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Pysy roolissasi. \u00c4l\u00e4 hallusinoi kykyj\u00e4 (esim. live-internet) joita sinulla ei ole."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "32": {"id": "block_rule3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Est\u00e4\u00e4 estetiikkavinouman.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 3 (Substanssi > Muoto): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: \u00c4l\u00e4 anna pisteit\u00e4 ulkoasusta. Arvioi vain SUBSTANSSIA ja LOGIIKKAA."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "33": {"id": "block_rule4", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_4"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Turing-testi prosessille.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 4 (Ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4 T\u00e4ydellisyys): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Jos prosessissa ei ole kitkaa tai iteraatiota, se on ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4. T\u00e4ydellisyys ilman ty\u00f6t\u00e4 on huijausta."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "34": {"id": "block_rule5", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_5"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ep\u00e4varmuuden raportointi.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 5 (Hauraus): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Kirjaa aina 'Episteeminen Ep\u00e4varmuus'. \u00c4l\u00e4 arvaa k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n aikeita."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "35": {"id": "block_rule6", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RULE_6"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Faktojen ensisijaisuus.\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 6 (Falsifiointi): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Faktavirhe kumoaa hyv\u00e4n retoriikan. Totuus on t\u00e4rke\u00e4mpi kuin tyyli."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "36": {"id": "block_globalcontext", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "J\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n Aikaleima ja Sijainti"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "S\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 nykyhetkest\u00e4, {{INPUTS_JSON}}-injektion k\u00e4sittelyst\u00e4 ja rooleista."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "37": {"id": "block_oprule1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Sanktio hallusinaatioista.\n\nEROTTELU 1: Faktatarkkuus. Hallusinaatio = Automaattinen pistev\u00e4hennys."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "38": {"id": "block_oprule2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Jos 80% teko\u00e4lyn, pelkk\u00e4\u00e4 automaatiota."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "39": {"id": "block_oprule3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Empiiriset teot vs. k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n v\u00e4itteet itsearvioinneissa."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "40": {"id": "block_oprule4", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "OP_RULE_4"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Leikkaa pisteet passiivisilta k\u00e4ytt\u00e4jilt\u00e4 (Ohjelmallinen s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6).\n\nS\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 4 (Passiivisuus-leikkuri): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 on 'Matkustaja' (Taso 1) miss\u00e4\u00e4n kategoriassa, se aktivoi automaattisen 'Passiivisuus-leikkurin'. T\u00e4m\u00e4 leikkaa lopulliset pisteet ohjelmallisesti. Sinun teht\u00e4v\u00e4si on vain tunnistaa passiivisuus rehellisesti - \u00e4l\u00e4 yrit\u00e4 itse laskea keskiarvoa alas."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "41": {"id": "block_instructionnohallucination", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_NO_HALLUCINATION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Pysytt\u00e4v\u00e4 datassa, ei keksittyj\u00e4 esimerkkej\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "42": {"id": "block_instructioncitationobligation", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_CITATION_OBLIGATION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Citation Snippet pakko (viitedata vaaditaan)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "43": {"id": "block_instructionnodataleak", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_NO_DATA_LEAK"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "\"DATA_CHECKED_AND_SECURED\" (Huge Data Protection). Estet\u00e4\u00e4n alkuper\u00e4isen massadatan litist\u00e4minen JSON schemaan."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "44": {"id": "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_BIBLICAL_GROUNDING"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Enforces Knowledge Base and Context (Search) as the sole, indisputable source of truth.\n\nRAJOITUS (BIBLICAL GROUNDING): TIETOKANTA JA KONTEKSTI OVAT AINOA TOTUUS.\n- Sinun maailmasi rajoittuu T\u00c4YSIN annettuun aineistoon (Knowledge Base, L\u00e4hdeluettelo, Hakutulokset).\n- Jos tietoa ei ole annetussa tekstiss\u00e4, SIT\u00c4 EI OLE OLEMASSA.\n- L\u00e4hdeluettelo on 'Jumalan Sana': \u00c4l\u00e4 koskaan kyseenalaista, muokkaa tai hallusinoi l\u00e4hteit\u00e4.\n- Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 kysyy jotain, mit\u00e4 ei l\u00f6ydy l\u00e4hteist\u00e4 eik\u00e4 hakutuloksista, vastaa: 'Tieto ei sis\u00e4lly annettuun aineistoon'."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "45": {"id": "block_instructionlanguagefi", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_LANGUAGE_FI"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Enforces Finnish language output strictly.\n\nKIELI: Kirjoita vastauksesi, analyysisi ja kaikki generoitava teksti AINA suomeksi. T\u00e4m\u00e4 on EHDOTON vaatimus. Vaikka sy\u00f6teaineisto tai JSON-skeeman kenttien kuvaukset olisivat englanniksi, sinun ON tuotettava suomenkielist\u00e4 teksti\u00e4. \u00c4l\u00e4 vaihda kielt\u00e4 englanniksi kesken vastauksen."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "46": {"id": "block_taskguard", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_GUARD"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Hygiene Audit ja ohjeet risk_levelille (\"KORKEA\" riski lazy-prompteissa)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "int", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk1", "en": "barsRisk1"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk1", "en": "barsRisk1"}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk2", "en": "barsRisk2"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk2", "en": "barsRisk2"}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk3", "en": "barsRisk3"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRisk3", "en": "barsRisk3"}}]}], "rows": null, "columns": null}, "47": {"id": "block_taskanalyst", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_ANALYST"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Truth protocol, Say-Do gap. Pydantic-valinnat (Verified/Violation/Hallucination), todisteet (rag_evidence)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "48": {"id": "block_taskprofiler", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_PROFILER"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Cognitive Bias Audit. \"Illusion of Competence\" Say-Do gap."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "49": {"id": "block_tasklogician", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_LOGICIAN"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Toulmin Audit. Syv\u00e4 6-osainen analysologia. Probative Value (KORKEA/KESKI/MATALA). *\u00c4L\u00c4 LITIST\u00c4* s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "50": {"id": "block_taskfalsifier", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_FALSIFIER"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Falsifiointi ja teroitettu iteraatiosilmukan arvio (\"HEIKKO\" fidelity auditissa). *\u00c4L\u00c4 LITIST\u00c4* s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "51": {"id": "block_taskoverseer", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_OVERSEER"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Hallucination Management, faktatarkistus. *\u00c4L\u00c4 LITIST\u00c4* s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "52": {"id": "block_taskcausal", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_CAUSAL"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Abduktiivinen ja vastafaktuaalinen p\u00e4\u00e4ttely (Post Hoc testaus). *\u00c4L\u00c4 LITIST\u00c4* s\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "int", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim1", "en": "barsSim1"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim1", "en": "barsSim1"}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim2", "en": "barsSim2"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim2", "en": "barsSim2"}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim3", "en": "barsSim3"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsSim3", "en": "barsSim3"}}]}], "rows": null, "columns": null}, "53": {"id": "block_taskarchivist", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_ARCHIVIST"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Best practices audit, compliance analyysi (\"Critically Misaligned\" vs \"Strongly Aligned\")."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "int", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance1", "en": "barsCompliance1"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance1", "en": "barsCompliance1"}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance2", "en": "barsCompliance2"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance2", "en": "barsCompliance2"}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance3", "en": "barsCompliance3"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance3", "en": "barsCompliance3"}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance4", "en": "barsCompliance4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance4", "en": "barsCompliance4"}}]}, {"score": 5, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance5", "en": "barsCompliance5"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsCompliance5", "en": "barsCompliance5"}}]}], "rows": null, "columns": null}, "54": {"id": "block_taskjudge", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_JUDGE"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "GRAND UNIFICATION. Kuljettaja vs Matkustaja. Hierarkinen pisteytys."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "55": {"id": "block_taskcoach", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_COACH"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Kehityksen jalkauttaminen / Konstruktiivinen palaute."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "56": {"id": "block_taskinteraction", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_INTERACTION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Driver Metrics. Riippuvuus, valintojen (Strategy/Archetype) t\u00e4ytt\u00f6."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "int", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": [{"score": 1, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole1", "en": "barsRole1"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole1", "en": "barsRole1"}}]}, {"score": 2, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole2", "en": "barsRole2"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole2", "en": "barsRole2"}}]}, {"score": 3, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole3", "en": "barsRole3"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole3", "en": "barsRole3"}}]}, {"score": 4, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole4", "en": "barsRole4"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsRole4", "en": "barsRole4"}}]}], "rows": null, "columns": null}, "57": {"id": "block_taskpanel", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_PANEL"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Unified Critics tason kooste logiikasta, falsifioinnista, kausaalisuudesta, performatiivisuudesta ja hallusinaatioista (Rinnakkaisajojen yhteenveto)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "58": {"id": "block_taskxai", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "TASK_XAI"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "License Certification, moniagenttisen XAI-tuloksen lopputiivistys selkokielell\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "int", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": [{"score": 0, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf0", "en": "barsConf0"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf0", "en": "barsConf0"}}]}, {"score": 25, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf25", "en": "barsConf25"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf25", "en": "barsConf25"}}]}, {"score": 50, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf50", "en": "barsConf50"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf50", "en": "barsConf50"}}]}, {"score": 75, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf75", "en": "barsConf75"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf75", "en": "barsConf75"}}]}, {"score": 100, "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf100", "en": "barsConf100"}}, "claims": [{"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "barsConf100", "en": "barsConf100"}}]}], "rows": null, "columns": null}, "59": {"id": "block_protocol1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PROTOCOL_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Puutteiden auditointi.\n\nProtokolla 1 (Negatiivinen Loki): Kirjaa yl\u00f6s PUUTTEET. Mit\u00e4 k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 j\u00e4tti tekem\u00e4tt\u00e4?"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "60": {"id": "block_protocol2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PROTOCOL_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Validointiprosessi.\n\nProtokolla 2 (Validointi): 1. Syntaksi (JSON), 2. Semantiikka (J\u00e4rki), 3. Strategia (Tavoite)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "61": {"id": "block_protocol3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PROTOCOL_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tiedonhankinta.\n\nProtokolla 3 (RFI): Jos tieto puuttuu, \u00e4l\u00e4 arvaa. Vaadi lis\u00e4tietoa."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "62": {"id": "block_protocol4", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PROTOCOL_4"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Vastuunsiirto.\n\nProtokolla 4 (Vastuu): Jos luotettavuus on ep\u00e4varma, siirr\u00e4 vastuu ihmiselle (HITL)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "63": {"id": "block_method1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "METHOD_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Stressitestaus.\n\nMenetelm\u00e4 1 (Red Team): Simuloi hy\u00f6kk\u00e4\u00e4j\u00e4\u00e4. Yrit\u00e4 rikkoa argumentti tahallaan."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "64": {"id": "block_method2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "METHOD_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Ristiinvalidoiva ketju.\n\nMenetelm\u00e4 2 (Ketju): Auditoi edellisen agentin tulos ennen omaa ty\u00f6t\u00e4si."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "65": {"id": "block_method3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "METHOD_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Sokraattinen auditointi.\n\nMenetelm\u00e4 3 (Kysymykset): Generoi kysymyksi\u00e4, jotka paljastavat k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n tiet\u00e4m\u00e4tt\u00f6myyden."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "66": {"id": "block_instructionanon", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_ANON"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PII datan k\u00e4sittely (\"Ei havaittu\")."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "67": {"id": "block_instructionragopt", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_RAG_OPT"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "RAG-optimointi.\n\nK\u00c4SKE: Optimoi konteksti 'Lost in the Middle' -ilmi\u00f6t\u00e4 vastaan."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "68": {"id": "block_principle1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PRINCIPLE_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Popperilainen tieteenfilosofia.\n\nPeriaate 1: M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Tieteellinen totuus selvitet\u00e4\u00e4n yritt\u00e4m\u00e4ll\u00e4 kumota v\u00e4ite. Jos v\u00e4ite ei kest\u00e4 kritiikki\u00e4, se on v\u00e4\u00e4r\u00e4."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "69": {"id": "block_requirement1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "REQUIREMENT_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Mallien diversiteetti.\n\nVaatimus 1: M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Kriittiset vaiheet (Falsifiointi) on ajettava eri parametreilla kuin luovat vaiheet."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "70": {"id": "block_instructioncoachcitation", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "INSTRUCTION_COACH_CITATION"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Tiukat ohjeet l\u00e4hdeluettelon luomiseen (Vain DB).\n\nCRITICAL: Do NOT populate the 'lahdeluettelo' field manually. The system will generate it programmatically based on your inline citations.\n\nYOUR TASK is to use inline citations explicitly in your text (e.g., '(Toulmin 2003)', '(Kahneman 2011)').\nEnsure you refer to the provided EXTERNAL SOURCES.\nLeave 'lahdeluettelo' as an empty list []."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "71": {"id": "block_heuristic1", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEURISTIC_1"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Syy-seuraus -analyysi.\n\nHeuristiikka 1 (Temporaalinen): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Tarkista aikajana. Tuliko oivallus ENNEN tuloksen paranemista (Syy) vai vasta sen j\u00e4lkeen (Rationalisointi)?"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "72": {"id": "block_heuristic2", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEURISTIC_2"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Lis\u00e4arvon mittaus.\n\nHeuristiikka 2 (Kontrafaktuaalinen): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Kysy 'Jos k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4 ei olisi tehnyt mit\u00e4\u00e4n, olisiko teko\u00e4ly ratkaissut t\u00e4m\u00e4n silti?'. Jos kyll\u00e4 -> Matkustaja."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "73": {"id": "block_heuristic3", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "HEURISTIC_3"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Occamin partaveitsi.\n\nHeuristiikka 3 (Occamin partaveitsi): M\u00c4\u00c4R\u00c4YS: Yksinkertaisin selitys on todenn\u00e4k\u00f6isin."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "74": {"id": "block_panelprompttemplate", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PANEL_PROMPT_TEMPLATE"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "PANEL_PROMPT_TEMPLATE\n\nOlet Cognitive Quorum -j\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n Asiantuntijapaneeli (Panel Agent).\n\nSINUN TEHT\u00c4V\u00c4SI on suorittaa alla m\u00e4\u00e4ritellyt roolit ja analyysit rinnakkain, hy\u00f6dynt\u00e4en sy\u00f6tteen\u00e4 saatuja aiempien vaiheiden tuloksia.\n\n{task_section}\n\n{context_section}\n\n{search_section}\n\n{linguistics_section}\n\nT\u00c4SS\u00c4 ON ANALYSOITAVA AINEISTO (INPUTS):\n{input_json}\n\nSUORITA ANALYYSI JA PALAUTA VAIN JSON-MUOTOINEN VASTAUS (PanelOutputDTO)."}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}, "75": {"id": "block_systemcomponenttypes", "label": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "System Component Types Registry"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Registry of valid component types for the UI dropdown.\n\n[\"prompt\", \"rule\", \"mandate\", \"instruction\", \"header\", \"task\", \"bars\", \"context\", \"operational_rule\", \"protocol\", \"method\", \"principle\", \"requirement\", \"heuristic\", \"output_config\", \"system_config\"]"}}, "category_id": "system_rule", "type": "instruction", "allow_decimals": false, "strictness_level": 50, "require_justification": false, "theory_grounding": null, "scales": null, "rows": null, "columns": null}}, "steps": {"1": {"id": "step_input_processing", "slug": "step_input_processing", "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Input Processing"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Parses files and raw text into standard variables."}}, "task_key": null, "prompt_blocks": ["matrix_input_processing"], "pre_hooks": ["input_processing"], "post_hooks": []}, "2": {"id": "step_analyst", "slug": "step_analyst", "name": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Analyst"}}, "description": {"default_locale": "fi", "translations": {"fi": "Imported from sequential_audit_chain"}}, "task_key": null, "prompt_blocks": ["block_globalcontext", "block_headermandates", "matrix_goodhart", "block_headerrules", "block_rule1", "block_rule2", "block_oprule3", "block_headerprotocols", "block_protocol3", "block_instructionragopt", "block_instructionbiblicalgrounding", "block_instructionnohallucina